#: src/components/smart-devices/SmartShower.tsx:27
msgid "Enable automatic shut-off after a period of inactivity to prevent water waste and save money. The system detects when you're not using water and shuts off automatically. This requires monitoring of your presence and activity patterns. Will you enable this water-saving feature despite the privacy trade-off?"
